    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you become a living vault for 1 minute. You gain truesight out to 30 feet, resistance to psychic and necrotic damage, and when a hostile creature starts its turn within 30 feet, it must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or be unable to speak above a whisper and unable to cast spells with verbal components until the start of its next turn. Once used, this feature cannot be used again until you finish a long rest.</p>",
